%% Séquence : authentification JWT — Gestion des Stages OCP
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Utilisateur
    participant NG as Angular (auth.service)
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AM as AuthenticationManager
    participant JS as JwtService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>NG: saisit identifiants + Login
    NG->>AC: POST /api/auth/login {username,password}
    AC->>AM: authenticate(username,password)
    AM->>DB: charge l'utilisateur (UserDetails)
    DB-->>AM: User (hash, rôle)
    AM-->>AC: Authentication OK
    AC->>JS: generateToken(userDetails)
    JS-->>AC: JWT signé (HS256, exp)
    AC-->>NG: 200 {token, role}
    NG->>NG: stocke currentUser dans localStorage
    Note over NG: requêtes suivantes
    NG->>AC: GET /api/... (auth.interceptor ajoute Bearer JWT)
    Note over AC: JwtAuthenticationFilter valide le token<br/>et peuple le SecurityContext
